WEBVTT

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:10.880
<v NARRATOR>In a world... where a one-bedroom apartment... costs three thousand, nine hundred and fifty dollars...

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:15.200
<v NARRATOR>...and gas is six dollars and eighty-nine cents... a gallon...

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:19.420
<v SURFER DUDE>Bro, my landlord just texted me "hey, quick question."

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:23.980
<v NARRATOR>One family... had a dream. And a Yoo-Haul.

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:27.040
<v NARRATOR>This fall... they're pointin' it at Austin.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:35.000
<v NARRATOR>Eighteen hundred and eighty miles. Of pure. American. Interstate.

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:38.260
<v NARRATOR>They'll face the Franchise Tax Board.

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:40.220
<v NARRATOR>They'll face the desert.

00:00:40.650 --> 00:00:43.530
<v NARRATOR>They'll face a tumbleweed the size of a Prius.

00:00:43.650 --> 00:00:45.570
<v SURFER DUDE>[screaming]

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:51.320
<v NARRATOR>They'll hunt for their supper. Mostly tacos.

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:55.940
<v NARRATOR>They'll ford mighty rivers... in a twenty-six-foot rental truck.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:59.920
<v SURFER DUDE>Dude, it's like, totally a shallow river. Probably.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:07.400
<v NARRATOR>And not all of 'em... are gonna make it.

00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:14.180
<v NARRATOR>Gas station sushi. Every dang time.

00:01:14.600 --> 00:01:28.760
<v NARRATOR>But for those who survive... a promised land. Where the sky is bigger. The trucks are bigger. And the state income tax is... zero.

00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:34.940
<v SURFER DUDE>Duuude. Is that a Buc-ee's? It's, like, the size of an airport.

00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:37.840
<v NARRATOR>Son... that's just the bathroom.

00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:45.260
<v NARRATOR>This fall... the West was lost. The South... got a lotta new neighbors.

00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:48.220
<v NARRATOR>The Texodus Trail.

00:01:57.900 --> 00:01:59.180
<v NARRATOR>Bless your heart.
